% c088: 45-56 Hn 1-2 sustained chords in four-bar phrase slurs with tenuto on the repeated notes (portato = soft, legato tonguing 'da', Adler I PDF 309; Ex. X-16 four horns under slurs, 'sehr weich'), matching the second idea's phrases.
sAHnOne = { R2.*28 | fis'2.~\f | fis'2.~ | fis'2. | d'4 r4 r4 | b'2.--(\mf | b'2.-- | a'2.-- | b'2.--) | a'2.--( | a'2.-- | a'2.-- | a'2.--) | b'2.--( | a'2.-- | b'2.--) | b'4-. r4 r4 | }
